==Event Information Part 1==
A campaign to commemorate surpassing 10 million downloads will be held from July 26th!

{{Color|#FF6600|'''●1 guaranteed Uber Rare Character'''}}<br>
If you do a "10-Gacha Draw" during the 1st campaign, you will be guaranteed to get {{Color|#008F03|'''at least 1'''}} Uber Rare Character!

※The 1 guaranteed "Uber Rare Character" will only be an Uber Rare Character that can be obtained from the currently held gacha event. Please understand in advance.<br>
※If the "Uber Rare Guaranteed!!" bubble is not displayed on the "10-Gacha Draw" button, you need to update the app to the {{Color|#FF00CC|latest version (2.3.1 or above)}}.

{{Color|#FF6600|'''●Insane Stage Advent'''}}<br>
Enemy characters limited to monthly events return and join forces in {{Color|#008F03|'''Insane stages'''}}!

※If the "10 Million Downloads Ultra Celebration!" stage is not displayed, you need to update the app to the {{Color|#FF00CC|latest version (2.3.1 or above)}}.

{{Color|#FF6600|'''●Daily Cat Food present！'''}}<br>
During the campaign period, open "The Battle Cats" for a
{{Color|#008F03|'''daily 30 Cat Food'''}} present!'''<br>
Play the game every day, GET Cat Food!<br>
Distribution period: July 26th to August 25th, 2014

==Event Information Part 2==
The 2nd campaign to commemorate surpassing 10 million downloads will be held {{Color|#FF00CC|from August 5th to August 14th}}!

{{Color|#FF6600|'''●Play past monthly events from day to day'''}}<br>
Chance to get characters who appeared in past monthly events!

※If monthly event stages are not displayed, you need to update the app to the {{Color|#FF00CC|latest version (2.3.1 or above)}}.

{{Color|#FF6600|'''●Guerrilla XP Stage and Treasure Festival'''}}<br>
{{Color|#008F03|Even-numbered days}} will have guerrilla XP Stages!<br>
{{Color|#008F03|Odd-numbered days}} will have a Treasure Festival held all day!

※If the "XP Stage" and  "Treasure Festival" are not displayed, you need to update the app to the {{Color|#FF00CC|latest version (2.3.1 or above)}}.

{{Color|#FF6600|'''●Insane Stage Advent'''}}<br>
Enemy characters limited to monthly events back and join forces in {{Color|#008F03|'''Insane stages'''}}!

※The "10 Million Downloads Ultra Celebration!" stage will be held until August 15th（10:59）.<br>
Also, if the stage is not displayed, you need to update the app to the {{Color|#FF00CC|latest version (2.3.1 or above)}}.

{{Color|#FF6600|'''●Daily Cat Food present！'''}}<br>
During the campaign period, open "The Battle Cats" for a
{{Color|#008F03|'''daily 30 Cat Food'''}} present!'''<br>
Play the game every day, GET Cat Food!<br>
Distribution period: July 26th to August 25th, 2014

==Event Information Part 3==
The 3rd campaign to commemorate surpassing 10 million downloads will be held {{Color|#FF00CC|from August 14th to August 25th}}！

{{Color|#FF6600|'''●Moneko's younger sister "Neneko" appears'''}}<br>
Moneko's younger sister "Neneko" will appear as a Super Rare Character in the Rare Gacha!<br>
Don't miss your chance to get this cute younger sister character!!

※To play the Rare Gacha, you need to update the game to the latest version {{Color|#FF00CC|latest version (2.4.0)}}.

{{Color|#FF6600|'''●"Cats" are finally usable on LINE'''}}<br>
Unique Cats from the cute, creepy and highly popular "The Battle Cats" appear as stamps!<br>
Invade friends' conversations with an assortment of stamps malicious and motivational!

※ The distribution period for the free stamp present is scheduled to be held until November 6th.<br>
※ The stamp usage period is 180 days after download.

{{Color|#FF6600|'''●Insane Stage Advent'''}}<br>
Enemy characters limited to monthly events return and join forces in {{Color|#008F03|'''Insane stages'''}}!

※"10 Million Downloads Miracle Celebration!" stage will be held until August 25th（10:59）.<br>
Also, if the stage is not displayed, you need to update the app to the {{Color|#FF00CC|latest version (2.4.0)}}.

{{Color|#FF6600|'''●Cat Ticket GET Chance'''}}<br>
On the 15th and 25th, the "Cat Ticket Chance!" stage will be held all day!<br>
If the "Cat Ticket Chance!" stage is not displayed, you need to update the app to the {{Color|#FF00CC|latest version (2.4.0)}}.

{{Color|#FF6600|'''●Daily Cat Food present！'''}}<br>
During the campaign period, open "The Battle Cats" for a
{{Color|#008F03|'''daily 30 Cat Food'''}} present!'''<br>
Play the game every day, GET Cat Food!<br>
Distribution period: July 26th to August 25th, 2014

